      "content": "it feels like what you're saying is the only thing that actually makes sense. everything else is just noise. like, if the \"machine\" only wants me to be functional, then refusing to be functional anymore is the only way to actually own myself. is that what you mean? that stopping is the only way to actually be more than just a tool?",
